---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, "/"); // "/profitprint/"
---
<Base title="Affiliate Disclosure — PrintProfit" description="How PrintProfit makes money and our affiliate relationships.">
  <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
  <p class="meta">Last updated 2026-08-01 · DRAFT — pending owner review before publication.</p>

    <p>PrintProfit is a small, independent project. To keep the calculator and guides free, some pages <strong>may contain affiliate links</strong>. If you click one and buy something, we may earn a commission &mdash; <strong>at no extra cost to you</strong>. Where a page carries them, it says so.</p>

  <h2>Our promises</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We only recommend products we'd consider using ourselves for a print business.</li>
    <li>A commission never changes our opinion or a product's ranking. We are not paid to write positive reviews, and we don't publish fake ones.</li>
    <li>We tell you plainly when we haven't personally tested something and are summarizing specs and public reviews instead.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Programs we participate in</h2>
  <p>As an Amazon Associate, PrintProfit earns from qualifying purchases. We may also link to our own paid product, the PrintProfit Pro Spreadsheet, sold via Payhip.</p>

  <p>Prices and availability shown on this site can change; the retailer's page is always the source of truth at the time of purchase. Questions? See the <a href={`${base}about/`}>About</a> page.</p>
</Base>
